  "interpretation": [
    "Both root draws form params at component+0x88, read the frame at +0x368, and traverse selected pairs from +0x380/+0x388 in 0x28-byte steps.",
    "Each entry holds a strong controller pair at +0/+8 and weak geometry pair at +0x10/+0x18. Native code promotes geometry through nonzero strong-count CAS before controller dispatch.",
    "The controller receives RCX=selected controller, RDX=component params, R8=promoted geometry. It reads geometry hierarchy at +0xe8 and supplies that same geometry in argument five of the seven-pointer body call.",
    "These windows do not establish every animation component field, skin identity constructor, geometry name reader, resource lifetime or native rendering phase. Existing independent guards remain."
